'm </span><span begin="00:31.450" end="00:31.930">always </span><span begin="00:31.930" end="00:32.290">gone</span><span begin="00:32.290" end="00:32.380">, </span><span begin="00:32.380" end="00:32.740">out </span><span begin="00:32.740" end="00:33.070">on </span><span begin="00:33.070" end="00:33.130">the </span><span begin="00:33.130" end="00:33.430">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.610" end="00:36.550"><span begin="00:33.610" end="00:34.030">I'm </span><span begin="00:34.030" end="00:34.330">on </span><span begin="00:34.330" end="00:34.420">the </span><span begin="00:34.420" end="00:34.810">run </span><span begin="00:34.810" end="00:34.930">and </span><span begin="00:34.930" end="00:35.200">you're </span><span begin="00:35.200" end="00:35.620">home </span><span begin="00:35.620" end="00:36.550">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.580" end="00:41.050"><span begin="00:36.580" end="00:37.090">I'm </span><span begin="00:37.090" end="00:37.720">too </span><span begin="00:37.720" end="00:39.040">consumed </span><span begin="00:39.040" end="00:39.370">with </span><span begin="00:39.370" end="00:39.670">my </span><span begin="00:39.670" end="00:40.300">own </span><span begin="00:40.300" end="00:41.050">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.110" end="00:47.590"><span begin="00:41.110" end="00:43.210">Are </span><span begin="00:43.210" end="00:43.480">we </span><span begin="00:43.480" end="00:44.770">too </span><span begin="00:44.770" end="00:45.370">young </span><span begin="00:45.370" end="00:45.700">for </span><span begin="00:45.700" end="00:46.660">this</span><span begin="00:46.660" end="00:47.590">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.590" end="00:50.320"><span begin="00:47.590" end="00:48.010">Feels </span><span begin="00:48.010" end="00:48.220">like </span><span begin="00:48.220" end="00:48.340">I </span><span begin="00:48.340" end="00:48.640">can't </span><span begin="00:48.640" end="00:50.320">move</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" be