begin="01:05.590" end="01:05.770">you</span><span begin="01:05.770" end="01:05.770">, </span><span begin="01:05.770" end="01:06.250">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.250" end="01:11.500"><span begin="01:06.250" end="01:06.340">I </span><span begin="01:06.340" end="01:06.550">can </span><span begin="01:06.550" end="01:06.850">hear </span><span begin="01:06.850" end="01:06.970">the </span><span begin="01:06.970" end="01:08.740">sound </span><span begin="01:08.740" end="01:09.010">of </span><span begin="01:09.010" end="01:09.730">breaking </span><span begin="01:09.730" end="01:11.500">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.420" end="01:27.520"><span begin="01:22.420" end="01:23.020">I've </span><span begin="01:23.020" end="01:23.620">been </span><span begin="01:23.620" end="01:25.030">confused </span><span begin="01:25.030" end="01:25.420">as </span><span begin="01:25.420" end="01:25.600">of </span><span begin="01:25.600" end="01:26.050">late </span><span begin="01:26.050" end="01:26.260">（</span><span begin="01:26.260" end="01:26.980">yeah</span><span begin="01:26.980" end="01:27.520">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.520" end="01:32.290"><span begin="01:27.520" end="01:28.780">Watching </span><span begin="01:28.780" end="01:29.410">my </span><span begin="01:29.410" end="01:29.980">youth </span><span begin="01:29.980" end="01:30.520">slip </span><span begin="01:30.520" end="01:31.180">away </span><span begin="01:31.180" end="01:31.420">（</span><span begin="01:31.420" end="01:31.810">yeah</span><span begin="01:31.810" end="01:32.290">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.290" end="01:34.720"><span begin="01:32.290" end="01:32.680">You're </span><span begin="01:32.680" end="01:33.040">like </span><span begin="01:33.040" end="01:33.100">the </span><span begin="01:33.100" end="01:33.580">sun</span><span begin="01:33.580" end="01:33.610">, </span><span begin="01:33.610" end="01:34.000">you </span><span begin="01:34.000" end="01:34.300">mak